# WN22-AC-000030: Windows Server 2022 must have the period of time before the bad logon counter is reset configured to 15 minutes or greater.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: medium
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-ac-000030-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `high`

    title `Windows Server 2022 must have the period of time before the bad logon counter is reset configured to 15 minutes or greater.`
    description `The account lockout feature, when enabled, prevents brute-force password attacks on the system. This parameter specifies the period of time that must pass after failed logon attempts before the counter is reset to "0". The smaller this value is, the less effective the account lockout feature will be in protecting the local system.`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,medium,account-policy,security-policy,ksi-iam-jit,ksi-iam-sus`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-IAM-JIT,KSI:KSI-IAM-SUS,NIST-800-53:AC-7`
    control_objective `KSI-IAM-JIT,KSI-IAM-SUS`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >> Account Policies >> Account Lockout Policy >> Reset account lockout counter after to at least "15" minutes.`

    component_id `comp-windows-security-policy`

    impl_KSI_IAM_JIT `Windows Server implements KSI-IAM-JIT by enforcing ResetLockoutCount per the STIG (Account lockout counter reset must be >= 15 minutes.). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_IAM_SUS `Windows Server implements KSI-IAM-SUS by enforcing ResetLockoutCount per the STIG (Account lockout counter reset must be >= 15 minutes.). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_AC_7 `Windows Server implements AC-7 by enforcing ResetLockoutCount per the STIG (Account lockout counter reset must be >= 15 minutes.). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        policy_name `ResetLockoutCount`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant
        exists boolean = true
        value_int int >= 15
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN windows_security_policy
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
